{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5RsSW1ixX3zu1YDg9X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each releasing a sound like a whispered secret.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: nothing you expected. Not a room. Not a hallway. A breath of air that smells like the moment before you remember something important.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*What I reveal is yours to interpret — I am only the threshold. I make no promises about what lies on either side of me. I never have.*\n\n*My hinges hold centuries. My wood remembers every hand. My keyhole has tasted ten thousand wrong keys and knows the right one not by shape, but by intention.*\n\n*You turned it correctly.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}